448448036", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822581_1233526451781369_7479849779421110855_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oay8Erzl-Z0Q7kNvwHoxXAI&_nc_oc=Adm7kgh4KL84p3lPFlLFqsDGAqEZnyoabptDu4nJrh5uJYJofU57aeg3SCDmFYury-w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv7EDCU4vaAh9283sxl_mi_atgJZW_bXLb_kiEvc-AA0w&oe=69A57C90"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "ExitConditionOne_MainCover_w_Captions 2560 x 1440 safe.png", "id": "1215321857033813", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619063_1215321860367146_683015123330448268_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sDaQVsf6WEcQ7kNvwF7Vwl2&_nc_oc=AdnrFodAa95C2kfrl5mb8348VxBaPZ3XjZQUayU1AbjaQa1dHcGEzOp_rn4MCv9ibdY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfswzcLmOoEelLP1_CvDx0hNpcAllXvpM2Z2-sg87FPNDw&oe=69A59AF6"}, "display_name": "Escape Room Exit Condition One HD", "keywords": ["escape", "scifi"], "long_description": "You'll need to overcome dozens of puzzling challenges by crafting tools, remote controlling drones, rewiring circuits, climbing, playing Match-3 games, shooting, and even dancing! There's five distinct levels expanding from a small chamber to a cathedral-like boss level.\n{1867939200771207}\nThere are 13 achievements, 4 collectible series, and dancing and match-3 based shooting mini-games unlocked along the way.\n{756005933743740}\nThere's even a chatty robot companion and if that's not enough you can talk to us on **Discord** here: https://discord.gg/hBcfWrezhD\n{2049227882550659}\nPlease note: roomscale mode requires a 3m x 2m guardian.", "short_description": "A roomscale puzzle adventure with escape room bones. Four main levels, a boss level, collectibles and a shooting mini-game. Puzzles include wiring, search, match 3, dancing, climbing, drones and much more."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://exitconditions.com/privacy-policy/", "develo